aha high school students by officers.  Omaha's superintendent requested the police stop using the gloves in schools.  Bellevue police will continue carrying the controversial devices for student safety.  Experts and parents criticize the gloves as abusive and inappropriate for schools.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/cops-used-electrocution-gloves-to-subdue-high-school-students-in-omaha-now-the-school-district-and-parents-are-pleading-with-police-to-stop-supposed-to-be-a-safe-space-for-students/articleshow/133459590.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/cops-used-electrocution-gloves-to-subdue-high-school-students-in-omaha-now-the-school-district-and-parents-are-pleading-with-police-to-stop-supposed-to-be-a-safe-space-for-students/articleshow/133459590.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T17:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133459659,imgsize-85422.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ecuador’s Indigenous women plant trees, grow cacao and protect the Amazon for their children]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133461712.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/ecuadors-indigenous-women-are-planting-trees-for-birds-growing-cacao-for-their-families-and-protecting-the-forest-for-their-children-to-save-the-amazon/articleshow/133461712.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/ecuadors-indigenous-women-are-planting-trees-for-birds-growing-cacao-for-their-families-and-protecting-the-forest-for-their-children-to-save-the-amazon/articleshow/133461712.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T16:29:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133462722,imgsize-877468.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Nitro Camden? Twitch streamer turns his life around after being kicked out of home]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133461100.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Nitro Camden went from averaging one Twitch viewer to becoming one of the platform’s most talked-about small creators after a 15,000-viewer raid from StableRonaldo turned into a family confrontation on camera. After being kicked out, Camden received help from Cinna, Adin Ross and other creators. Doja Cat also publicly urged fans to support him. Days later, Camden reached Partner status on both Twitch and Kick and gained over 250,000 followers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-nitro-camden-twitch-streamer-going-viral-for-turning-his-life-around-after-being-kicked-out-of-home/articleshow/133461100.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-nitro-camden-twitch-streamer-going-viral-for-turning-his-life-around-after-being-kicked-out-of-home/articleshow/133461100.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T16:04:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133461558,imgsize-131656.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What happened between YouTubers MeganPlays and Leah Ashe? Their friendship fallout explained]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133460790.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The friendship between Roblox YouTubers MeganPlays and Leah Ashe has come to a troubled end after Leah started dating M