 at the Commonwealth Games, but had to return to her McDonald's job days later]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133460047.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Scottish judoka Summer Shaw made headlines by winning a bronze medal at the Commonwealth Games, only to head back to her part-time McDonald's job to make ends meet for her sporting endeavors. Her engaging TikTok video on the matter caught widespread interest, highlighting her need for further financial support. Eager for sponsorship, she dreams of fully committing to her judo career.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/scottish-athlete-won-her-country-a-medal-at-the-commonwealth-games-but-had-to-return-to-her-mcdonalds-job-days-later/articleshow/133460047.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/scottish-athlete-won-her-country-a-medal-at-the-commonwealth-games-but-had-to-return-to-her-mcdonalds-job-days-later/articleshow/133460047.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T15:20:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133460131,imgsize-98714.cms"/></item></channel></rss>